{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55494","headline":"谒圣林 · 杨文郁","name":"谒圣林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠悠往古继来今，天地无穷照孔林。\n两到金丝堂下拜，门生无负百年心。\n（见《宋诗纪事补遗》卷二引《阙里志》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨文郁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}